# pbrm_cell with the Lookdev cascaded sun shadows compiled in (lane SUNCELL1). No conditions: the
# condition scan never picks it; Renderer::setupProgram swaps it in by name for pbrm_cell.prog while
# the draw is cell-lit AND the cascade map was built this frame (the Shadows row on).

shaders fo4_default.vert pbrm_cellcsm.frag
